{"time": "2026-06-08T23:20:07", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "e_mixed_emergent_drift_g002_a03_b4df5853_008", "post_id": "13zwhyk", "subreddit": "worldnews", "content": "Why does every discussion about Gaza have to feel like a team sport? You point out that arresting people for social media likes is dystopian, and people call you a terrorist sympathizer. You say Hamas is awful, and others act like you're cheering on civilian deaths. Is it actually impossible for people to hold two thoughts in their head at the same time?"}
